cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the lens database or the chart, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "LensDB: a curated specification database of mirrorless camera lenses"
abstract: >-
  Focal length, aperture, weight, size, filter thread, mount, format, focus and stabilization
  specs, production status, and last known price for 721 lenses across 20 brands, compiled from
  public manufacturer pages with per-segment provenance, and an interactive comparison chart
  built on it.
authors:
  - name: "Luminoid"
    website: "https://luminoid.dev"
date-released: 2026-08-30
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Luminoid/lens-db"
url: "https://lens.luminoid.dev"
keywords:
  - camera lenses
  - mirrorless
  - photography
  - lens comparison
  - dataset
  - data visualization
